#Command Briefing

$Stage Text:
 XSTR("Captain Emora Leciq,

I am pleased that you have agreed to transport our cargo aboard the $f Tayana $f Star$|.  We have come to rely on your speed and discretion.  The sealed crates will be waiting for you at the $y Bilbringi $y 9 supply depot, landing pad 2.  For security purposes, we cannot disclose the final coordinates and time of our rendezvous, but the dockyard central computer at the Ostro Shipping Complex on $y Ledos will be able to provide you with details.  We can pay you 2,000 there, and a further 5,000 upon your arrival at the final destination.  Our thanks, and safe journey.

-Leks Rulona", 2177)
$end_multi_text
$Ani Filename: <default>
+Wave Filename: S1_M1_cb1.ogg

$Stage Text:
 XSTR("Emora,       

Things have been heating up in $y Bilbringi$|, and we're pulling everything we can out of the system.  I know you've moved supplies for us before, but these units are custom--it won't take a genius to figure out who you're working for.  If you get boarded, the $h Empire won't bother fining you, and they'll come after your people on $y Duro too, knowing how they feel about non-humans.  Have Nines set the self-destruct if things get too tight.  You can always get a new ship, and you know there's a job waiting for you here whenever you're ready.

Take care, and record anything unusual you see in $y Bilbringi$|.  We can use any type of intelligence we can get our hands on.

-Avon Du'Elo
", 2178)
$end_multi_text
$Ani Filename: <default>
+Wave Filename: S1_M1_cb2.ogg

#Briefing
$start_briefing
$num_stages: 3
$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("Mistress Leciq, loading has been completed, and it appears that Captain Du'Elo was not exaggerating about the cargo.  Our scans indicate that these are the high-end power plants used in the $f Rebels' new starfighters.  We will surely be tortured and executed if the $h Empire searches our hold.  Perhaps now would be a good time to purchase and install my long-promised escape pod.", 2179)
$end_multi_text
$voice: S1_M1_b1.ogg
$camera_pos: 0.000000, 12870.666016, 7551.539062
$camera_orient:
	1.000000, 0.000000, 0.000000,
	0.000000, -0.000065, 1.000000,
	0.000000, -1.000000, -0.000065
$camera_time: 2000
$num_lines: 0
$num_icons: 2
$Flags: 0
$Formula: ( true ) 
$start_icon
$type: 12
$team: Friendly
$class: Corellian Star Shuttle
$pos: 926.190308, -3500.014404, 7169.102539
$label:  XSTR("Tayana Star", 1482)
+id: 3
$hlight: 1
$mirror: 1
$multi_text
$end_multi_text
$end_icon
$start_icon
$type: 0
$team: Friendly
$class: N-1 Starfighter#Red
$pos: -4611.928223, -16000.001953, 7021.212402
$label:  XSTR("Highly Illegal Cargo", 2180)
+id: 12
$hlight: 0
$mirror: 0
$multi_text
$end_multi_text
$end_icon
$end_stage
$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("I take it we have not yet found a buyer for the weapons and fighter parts I procured on $y Mantooine$|.  It is doubtful the $f Alliance will be interested in such low-quality hardware--do you have another customer in mind?  I feel compelled to remind you that while the port authority can ensure the security of black market activity within this system, we may be hard-pressed to safely offload this type of merchandise elsewhere.", 2181)
$end_multi_text
$voice: S1_M1_b2.ogg
$camera_pos: 2004.665527, 6939.522461, 7390.041504
$camera_orient:
	1.000000, 0.000000, 0.000000,
	0.000000, -0.000065, 1.000000,
	0.000000, -1.000000, -0.000065
$camera_time: 2000
$num_lines: 0
$num_icons: 2
$Flags: 0
$Formula: ( true ) 
$start_icon
$type: 12
$team: Friendly
$class: Corellian Star Shuttle
$pos: 3463.865967, -3500.015137, 7215.648438
$label:  XSTR("Tayana Star", 1482)
+id: 3
$hlight: 0
$mirror: 1
$multi_text
$end_multi_text
$end_icon
$start_icon
$type: 0
$team: Friendly
$class: N-1 Starfighter#Red
$pos: -1500.279541, -21914.332031, 6763.997559
$label:  XSTR("Dubiously Legal Cargo", 2182)
+id: 13
$hlight: 0
$mirror: 0
$multi_text
$end_multi_text
$end_icon
$end_stage
$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("A general warning is in effect due to a recent accident at the $y hypermatter $y fueling $y station$|, but we have more than enough in current fuel reserves to reach $y Ledos$|.  The $h Star $h Destroyer $h Convictor also remains in the area, but it has made no moves since the warning was issued.  Our outbound course will show us the far side of the station asteroid, and I will document any activity there as per your orders.  If you wish to board your fighter, we can be underway immediately.", 2183)
$end_multi_text
$voice: S1_M1_b3.ogg
$camera_pos: 0.000000, 25375.033203, 7552.381836
$camera_orient:
	1.000000, 0.000000, 0.000000,
