$Name: Ab - Attention
$Team: -1
$MessageNew:  XSTR("Attention, all vessels.  Power down your drives immediately and prepare to be boarded.  All traffic in and around the Bilbringi System is hereby suspended pending an investigation of this attack.  Failure to cooperate will be met with severe punishment.", 1518)
$end_multi_text
+Wave Name: I1_M3_Ors_1.ogg

$Name: Charmed surrenders
$Team: -1
$MessageNew:  XSTR("Charmed here.  Hold your fire, please!  We're shutting down engines now.", 1520)
$end_multi_text
+Wave Name: S1_M1_Charmed_1.ogg

$Name: Sullustan gibberish
$Team: -1
$MessageNew:  XSTR("You Imperial Ranats will never take us ali--", 1521)
$end_multi_text
+Wave Name: S1_M1_Sulonan_1.ogg

$Name: Zaltin 12 complains
$Team: -1
$MessageNew:  XSTR("This bacta is urgently needed on Taris, Convictor!  You have no right to interfere with cartel operations!", 1522)
$end_multi_text
+Wave Name: S1_M1_Zaltin_1.ogg

$Name: .. UR - Power Spike
$Team: -1
$MessageNew:  XSTR("BB9 Open, this is Ulabos Ringer.  We're detecting a power spike at the fueling facility.  Do you want us to...  oh no...  Sithspit!  Camin, get us out of--", 2203)
$end_multi_text
+Wave Name: S1_M1_Ulabos_1.ogg

$Name: TS - Imps Inbound
$Team: -1
$MessageNew:  XSTR("Mistress, we have Imperial contacts inbound.  Our present course will now lead us into a highly dangerous area, and this vessel does not have the maneuverability to navigate safely through.", 2204)
$end_multi_text
+Wave Name: S1_M1_Nines_2.ogg

