$Name: Rampant - Take this info
$Team: -1
$MessageNew:  XSTR("Rampant 1 to Tayana Star: the Empire's blitzed us all across the system.  The shipyards are a war zone--they knew just where to find us.  We need you to bring this data from the battle to any Alliance cell you can reach.  Good luck.", 2212)
$end_multi_text
+Wave Name: S1_M1_Rampant_1.ogg

$Name: Incoming Datastream
